This application contains INTENTIONAL security vulnerabilities for teaching
and practice. It is the software equivalent of a crash-test dummy.

It is created by the student ethical hacking organization, ITUnderground, at the IT-University of Copenhagen.

Docker is required to run this project. 
It can be downloaded in two forms: https://docs.docker.com/desktop/ 
- Docker engine: https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/ 
- Docker desktop (includes the docker engine): 

To run this project, simply run this command in your terminal:
```sh
docker compose up
```